# Third-party film stills, posters and photographs, gathered as art-direction reference
# for the brand and never cleared for redistribution. Untracked in Batch U3 at Craig's
# pick (OWNER-ACTIONS.md 15, DECISIONS.md #221): they stay on disk, and in history before
# that commit. A photograph arrives as a JPEG, so none is tracked anywhere under docs/brand.
docs/brand/source-images/
docs/brand/logo-system/concepts/*/sources/
docs/brand/logo-system/concepts/catalogue-frame-v2/poster-source-grid.png
docs/brand/**/*.jpg
docs/brand/**/*.jpeg

# A review's working files (docs/agent-commands/review-wave.md): persistent, never committed.
scratchpad/

# Craig's spreadsheets (the catalogue he imports from) live in the repo root and are his:
# ignored by pattern so a `git add` never takes them, never deleted by an agent.
*.xlsx
